  <p id="c-jinshu-056-jin098-dun-early:southern-dismissal" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">及<persName id="c-jinshu-056-jin098-dun-early:southern-dismissal:m0001" ref="74e_68c_9ae">太子</persName>廢，徙許昌，<persName id="c-jinshu-056-jin098-dun-early:southern-dismissal:m0009" ref="c27_590_7e3_A">賈后</persName>諷有司不聽宮臣追送。<persName id="c-jinshu-056-jin098-dun-early:southern-dismissal:m0021" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w">統</persName>與宮臣冒禁至伊水，拜辭道左，悲泣流漣。</p>
</text>
